OL,3,AUS Army to detonate tonnes of unstable 
OL,4,Aexplosives in Iowa despite court order 
OL,6,FThe US Army plans to move ahead with   
OL,7,Fdetonating five tonnes of degraded     
OL,8,Fexplosives in Iowa despite a ruling to 
OL,9,Fhalt it indefinitely, a new court      
OL,10,Ffiling shows.                          
OL,12,F"To protect its personnel and the      
OL,13,Fsurrounding communities, the Army needs
OL,14,Fto take swift action," the justice     
OL,15,Fdepartment notified the court on       
OL,16,FSaturday. "Protection of human health  
OL,17,Fand the environment demand action now, 
OL,18,Fnot delay."                            
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
