OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUS Army to detonate tonnes of unstable 
OL,4,Aexplosives in Iowa despite court order 
OL,6,FThe court had ordered a pause after    
OL,7,Fenvironmental groups sued to stop the  
OL,8,Fdetonation, arguing the army failed to 
OL,9,Fconsider safer alternatives.           
OL,11,FThe detonation was originally scheduled
OL,12,Ffor Friday at the Iowa Army Ammunition 
OL,13,FPlant in Middletown. The army now plans
OL,14,Fto act by 24 November under an         
OL,15,Femergency exemption.                   
